/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/40px-Cleave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/60px-Cleave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/80px-Cleave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/40px-Cleave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Swing your weapon in a large arc to attack up to 3 enemies at once. They each take half the damage your weapon usually deals. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-28&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;129</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite this weapon's description, the spell-caster's ability modifier applies to Attack Rolls <i><b>and</b></i> Damage Rolls made with this weapon.</li>\n<li>Like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shillelagh\" title=\"Shillelagh\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/25px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/38px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/50px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shillelagh\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/25px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shillelagh\" title=\"Shillelagh\">Shillelagh</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\">Infernal Rapier</a>, this weapon uses the character's high